  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;SUPING LU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Suping Lu is a professor born in 1955, affiliated with the University of Nebraska–Lincoln and the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência. She has a distinguished academic career with a focus on cellular signaling pathways and genetic research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF NEBRASKA–LINCOLN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University of Nebraska–Lincoln is a public university located in Lincoln, Nebraska, United States, where Suping Lu has worked as a professor."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INSTITUTO GULBENKIAN DE CIÊNCIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência is an esteemed institution in Oeiras, Portugal, where Suping Lu has been a part of since the early 2000s, focusing on biological and biomedical research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OEIRAS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Oeiras is a municipality in Portugal where the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CELLULAR SIGNALING PATHWAYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cellular Signaling Pathways refer to the mechanisms by which cells communicate and coordinate their activities, which is the focus of Suping Lu's research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENETIC RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genetic Research involves studying the structure, function, and behavior of genes, which is a significant aspect of Suping Lu's work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLING HILLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rolling Hills are mentioned as part of the landscape in Oeiras, Portugal, where the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência is situated."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PORTUGAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Portugal is the country where the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência is located."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAFETERIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cafeteria is a place within the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência where coffee is served, mentioned as a source of enticing aroma."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CORRIDORS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Corridors of the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência are bustling and familiar to Professor Suping Lu."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LABORATORIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Laboratories at the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência are hubs of activity where research is conducted."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CENTRIFUGES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Centrifuges are mentioned as part of the laboratory equipment at the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência, contributing to the research environment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STUDENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Students are mentioned as part of the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência community, engaged in discussions and presentations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCHERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Researchers are part of the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência community, contributing to the advancement of biological and biomedical research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DNA DOUBLE HELIX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A DNA Double Helix is symbolized by the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência's logo, representing the commitment to advancing biological and biomedical research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOLOGICAL RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biological Research is a key area of focus at the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência, where Suping Lu contributes to the understanding of cellular processes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOMEDICAL RESEARCH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biomedical Research is another key area of focus at the Instituto Gulbenkian de Ciência, where Suping Lu contributes to the understanding of human health and disease."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENETIC MUTATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genetic Mutations are studied by Suping Lu and her colleagues, with implications for disease treatment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FAMILY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Suping Lu's family is mentioned as a support system for her scientific pursuits."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0495</data>
    </node>
